[1285.781196, "o", "tma 128x128x64 w8 s3: 2.948 ms viol=0.4038\r\ntma 128x128x64 w8 s4: 3.073 ms viol=0.4038\r\ntma 128x128x32 w8 s4: 2.618 ms viol=0.4030\r\ntma 128x256x64 w8 s2: 3.049 ms viol=0.4038\r\ntma 256x128x64 w8 s2: 3.563 ms viol=0.4038\r\ntma 128x256x64 w8 s3: FAIL OutOfResources: out of resource: shared memory, Required: 262192, Hardware limit: 232448. Reducing block sizes or `n\r\ntma 128x128x128 w8 s2: 3.664 ms viol=0.4038\r\ntma 256x128x128 w8 s2: FAIL OutOfResources: out of resource: shared memory, Required: 262168, Hardware limit: 232448. Reducing block sizes or `n\r\ntma 128x256x128 w8 s2: FAIL OutOfResources: out of resource: shared memory, Required: 327704, Hardware limit: 232448. Reducing block sizes or `n\r\n"]
